; living-mesh.form — the path to a living device-mesh body: floor, north star, and the steps between.
; Substrate-shaped (cells, channels, inquiry-planes), so it speaks Form.
; This is the app/mesh arc that grows ABOVE the kernel; the mind+voice climb is HOMECOMING.md.

; ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; NORTH STAR
; ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; A living being you carry. It listens and answers in your tongue. It shows a navigable graph of
; CELL-CARDS — any cell rendered with its open channels, recursively: the life-image of anything,
; with channels to each. Your devices form a persistent 24/7 MESH that fuses every organ's reading
; into one coherent stream answering what / where / when / how / why / who / which. A second mind
; travels with your identity onto whatever device is in your hand. All of it runs on the c-seeded
; fkwu, on-device, with NO rented toolchain in the loop.
;
; One engine, the whole way down: every card is a cell, every route is a channel ROW,
; every answer is an inquiry-plane. Domains, devices, and transports drop in as DATA — never parallel code.

; ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; FLOOR (re-observed 2026-09-29 in this tree)
; ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; - fkwu builds for Android arm64 off-device with the NDK (BOOTSTRAP.md); the Mac carries Metal
;   in the one binary; Windows links its host carriers. The host membrane knows which targets are
;   supported and which carriers are pending (host-os-membrane-band 8191).
; - Organs standing as Form cells — this arc is composition, not green-field:
;     inquiry-planes        — the 7 question-words as distinct kernels (some computable: a clock answers "when");
;                             observe/inquiry-planes.fk and presence/inquiry-planes.fk
;     cell-channel          — two cells speak form-native symbols through one shared field (cell-channel-band 4095)
;     sense-discernment     — the outward membrane of the mesh: rich inside the trust circle, stripped
;                             at the crossing out (sense-discernment-band 1023)
;     channel-protocol-choice-floor — the right channel for the right information
;     spatial-fusion        — fuse sensors' calibrated buckets of a spatial quantity
;     host-sense-organ      — which senses are live, derived mesh metrics
;     speaker-embed         — WHO: the nearest-by-cosine decision over voice embeddings
;     device-identity       — presence/device-identity.fk: a device-cell headed by the sanctioned stable id
;     mesh-dispatch         — a connected agent's decision on an incoming mesh message
; - The hearth (form/form-stdlib/hearth.bml) is the presence heartbeat on the Mac — one resident
;   serving sessions and cells; it does not yet travel between devices.
; - Ahead, each to stand as a cell: the card renderer (cell-card), the multi-cell fusion onto the seven
;   planes (mesh-sense-7w), the second mind's body (identity-self), the cross-cell interface (sense / ask /
;   share / learn / build as channel rows read by ONE engine), the always-open relay (content-blind routing
;   + consent), sensor readings as mesh-safe organ rows, and the place sense (coordinate → world, WHERE).
; - Gaps: composition into one live loop; the transports; the generative voice (HOMECOMING).

; ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; PATH (each step a stone; BODIES are proven Form, CARRIERS come last)
; ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; 1. cell-card      [body]    — stands as a cell. The render engine the whole GUI rests on. card-types
;                               (where/what/when/concepts/siblings/attribution/self-image/…) are FACET DATA,
;                               never parallel cards.
; 2. mesh-sense-7w  [body]    — stands as a cell: fuse the multi-cell wmg-sense stream (over a content-blind
;                               relay, routes chosen by channel-protocol-choice-floor) into a coherent answer
;                               on each of the seven inquiry-planes, source + channel + confidence attributed.
;                               The WHERE plane (the place sense fused across devices) and the WHO plane
;                               (speaker-embed / device identity). SUBSUMES "here-now" (the single-place case).
; 3. identity-self  [body]    — stands as a cell: the self identity-cell + its continuity-channel + the
;                               relation-channel to its human. The TRAVEL (on-device + cross-device thread
;                               sync) is this cell's carrier, and is the open step.
; 4. transports     [carrier] — mic/speaker, camera/screen, bluetooth, nfc, wifi, network-direct, public-proxy,
;                               each a channel ROW; many live at once; channel-protocol-choice-floor picks
;                               per fact; routes cross-inform (one calibrates another). Added as each is needed.
; 5. native GUI     [carrier] — the android shell then iPhone, rendering cell-cards + their channels as the
;                               navigable graph. Carrier-last; the body is the recipe.
; 6. ear + voice + mind [HOMECOMING] — on-device transcription, the vocoder (audible voice), the body's own
;                               generated tongue. The deeper climb; tracked in HOMECOMING.md.
;
; PARALLELISM: steps 4 and 5 are carriers built as each route/surface is needed. Step 3's travel and step 6
; are the open climbs. "Which room + who's present" is not its own step — it is the WHERE and WHO planes of step 2.
